<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS6" title="In 6.2 Evaluation results ‣ 6 Evaluation ‣ FunAudio-ASR Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2.6 </span>Multilingual ASR Results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS7" title="In 6.2 Evaluation results ‣ 6 Evaluation ‣ FunAudio-ASR Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2.7 </span>Effect of Reinforcement Learning</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In FunAudio-ASR Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Limitations and Future Plans</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In FunAudio-ASR Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In FunAudio-ASR Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Authors (in alphabetical order of last name)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S10" title="In FunAudio-ASR Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">10 </span>Acknowledgment</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In FunAudio-ASR Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
