<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Evaluation results in terms of WER (%) or CER (%) on different <span id="S6.T7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">multilingual test sets</span>.</figcaption>
